Subject: [PATCH] KHopeSpigot: optimize world and backpressure hot paths

---
 .../minecraft/server/ChunkProviderServer.java | 46 +++++++++----------
 .../net/minecraft/server/EntityTracker.java   | 17 ++++---
 .../net/minecraft/server/PlayerChunkMap.java  | 37 +++++++++------
